          "lua_implementation": "EVENT_BE_MATERIAL grants the qualifying Xyz Monster a Main Phase Quick Effect. After the activation-legality check, its target callback rolls the die before the Chain can continue and stores ceil(result/2) on the granted effect. Resolution uses that saved cap without rerolling and lets the controller banish between one and that many eligible opposing GY cards.",
